<!--
  Studio launcher icon — a dot-matrix "N", drawn from the same rule as every other dot
  grid in this system: it must encode something, not decorate.
  A launcher icon cannot bind to live app state the way DotMatrixReadout does, so the
  honest content here is the brand mark itself — the one thing that is always true about
  this icon, on every device, forever. That is different from a checkerboard pattern,
  which is decoration with no referent.
  Dots sit on the same pitch rule as the rest of the system (a spacing-scaled grid, not an
  arbitrary one) and use the real dark-mode tokens: bg (#000000) and textDisplay (#FFFFFF),
  not the stale #050505/#F5F5F5 pair this file held before.
-->
